LG Electronics Development Vietnam (LGEDV) Company focuses on smart \& eco\-friendly automotive components. The VC Company produces high\-quality \& state\-of\-the\-art in\-car infotainment systems that deliver both information and entertainment on the go for many of the world‘s biggest automobile brands.










 We, LG Electronics Development Vietnam (LGEDV), conduct core R\&D activities, and various product reliability tests to support our vehicle component business.










 As a Java Software Engineer of LGEDV in the Da Nang office, your roles \& responsibilities will be as below:



* Research and develop applications for Car Infotainment, AVN (Audio Video Navigation) systems, Cluster and Telematics
* Develop automotive products and technologies (including HMI Applications, HMI frameworks, Protocols to interface with HMI framework and middleware …)
* Responsible for software delivery to headquarters;
* Generate reports, and communicate with local management and headquarters.









**1\. General requirements:** 



* Bachelor's degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Telecommunication Engineering, Mathematics, Mechanics, and Informatics or equivalent;
* Strong motivation to develop a career in the automotive software field;
* 2\+ years’ experience in software development using either Java or Kotlin;
* Solid knowledge of OOP and Design Patterns;
* Having hands\-on experience in using at least one version control tool such as Git, Gerrit;
* Having hands\-on experience in using JIRA, VLM, Cand ollab.









***These skills would be considered as an advantage but not a must:***



* Having experience in AVN (Audio\-Video\-Navigation) software development;
* Having experience in developing at
 **Android framework layer** 
 ; Having experience in Agile project, V\-model software development;
* Having experience in developing at UML;
* Good communication in English \& Vietnamese;
* Ability to effectively present information to top management, public groups, and/or board of directors..









**2\. What we offer:** 



* Hybrid Working Environment
* Attractive and competitive salary package;
